# nginx 反向代理（HTTPS 終止在 nginx，憑證可用 certbot 申請）。遊戲在 https 網頁上，所以一定要 wss://，不能只開 http。
server {
    listen 443 ssl http2;
    server_name sf2.example.com;
    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/sf2.example.com/fullchain.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/sf2.example.com/privkey.pem;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8787;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;      # WebSocket（/ws）必要
        proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $remote_addr;
        proxy_read_timeout 120s;                     # 伺服器每 25 秒 ping 一次，要大於它
    }
}
# Caddy 更簡單（自動申請憑證），整個 Caddyfile 只要：
#   sf2.example.com {
#       reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8787
#   }
